# Grants for Arts, Culture & the Humanities. 2012 Digital Edition

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This publication is only available as a downloadable file. See who's giving and getting grants in your field. Strengthen your search for funds with the Foundation Center's digital edition of "Grants for Arts, Culture & The Humanities." This new "Grant Guide" reveals the scope of current foundation giving in the field. You'll find descriptions of 24,664 grants of $10,000 or more with a total value of $2,903,129,358 made by made by 1,135 foundations. "Grants for Arts, Culture & The Humanities" is essential for identifying prospective funders for general support or specific projects.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED538096

